---
title: Job card status workflow — every move is recorded with time, person and reason
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Draft" as draft
  state "Awaiting inspection" as awaiting_inspection
  state "Awaiting estimate" as awaiting_estimate
  state "Awaiting customer approval" as awaiting_approval
  state "Approved" as approved
  state "Awaiting assignment" as awaiting_assignment
  state "In progress" as in_progress
  state "Quality check" as quality_check
  state "Ready for delivery" as ready_for_delivery
  state "Delivered" as delivered
  state "On hold" as on_hold
  state "Cancelled" as cancelled

  [*] --> draft: Save as draft
  [*] --> awaiting_inspection: Check in
  draft --> awaiting_inspection: Check in vehicle
  awaiting_inspection --> awaiting_estimate: ⚙ Inspection completed
  awaiting_inspection --> awaiting_estimate: Skip inspection *
  awaiting_estimate --> awaiting_approval: ⚙ Estimate sent
  awaiting_approval --> approved: ⚙ Customer approved (all or some)
  awaiting_approval --> awaiting_estimate: ⚙ Customer declined / ⚙ revision started *
  approved --> awaiting_estimate: ⚙ Revision started *
  approved --> awaiting_assignment: Ready to assign
  awaiting_assignment --> awaiting_estimate: ⚙ Revision started *
  awaiting_assignment --> in_progress: Start work
  in_progress --> awaiting_estimate: Additional work found *
  in_progress --> quality_check: Work complete
  quality_check --> ready_for_delivery: Quality check passed
  quality_check --> in_progress: Send back for rework *
  ready_for_delivery --> delivered: Deliver to customer
  delivered --> [*]

  in_progress --> on_hold: Put on hold * (from any active status)
  on_hold --> in_progress: Resume (returns to the status it was in)
  awaiting_estimate --> cancelled: Cancel * (from any status before delivery)
  cancelled --> [*]

  note left of awaiting_inspection
    * = a reason is required
    ⚙ = moved by the system when the inspection
    is completed, an estimate is sent or revised,
    or the customer decides — not a button
  end note
  note right of cancelled
    Delivered and cancelled jobs are locked.
  end note
